Visual audit fixes (Iteration 4):
- BUG FIX: currentTab initialized to -1 (was 0, causing switchTab(TAB_HOME) early return → blank screen)
- Cards: card_bg.xml (white rounded 16dp + 1dp #E9E5DF border) replaces flat setBackgroundColor
- Buttons: btn_primary.xml (vermilion rounded 12dp), btn_ghost.xml (transparent + border),
  btn_success.xml (green rounded 12dp); all isAllCaps=false
- ProgressBar: native ProgressBar with setProgressTintList/setProgressBackgroundTintList (vermilion)
- Search: input_bg.xml (white rounded 10dp + border) replaces default android editbox
- Back buttons: TextView with transparent background (no default button styling)
- Navigation: letter badges (H, L, V, R, P) instead of unicode symbols
- Spacing: dp() helper (Int signature) for consistent dp-to-px conversion
- Lesson card: whole card tappable, hint text below, tap-to-reveal meaning
- Avatar: TextView with btn_primary background (not Button)
- Done button: btn_success.xml when at last word, btn_primary.xml otherwise

Fixes applied during build (Iteration 0-4):
- aapt2 compile/link: pass individual files, not directories
- activity_card/lesson/main.xml: removed (replaced by programmatic views)
- ic_launcher_circle.xml: encoding="utf-8"
- FlipCardView: custom Animation with Camera (Rotate3dAnimation not in SDK)
- Activities: android.app.Activity (no androidx/Gradle)
- d8: pass individual .class files, not directories
- Kotlin stdlib: bundled in DEX (was missing → instant crash on open)
- uses-sdk: minSdkVersion=21 / targetSdkVersion=34 (was missing → "not compatible")
- LinearLayout.LayoutParams.weight used instead of View.weight
- dp(): Int parameter (was Float, caused argument type mismatch on all Int literals)
- ProgressBar tint: setProgressTintList/setProgressBackgroundTintList (method names, not properties)

Root cause of instant crash: Kotlin standard library was compiled against but not bundled in the APK.
Every Kotlin class (data classes, listOf, object HskData) threw NoClassDefFoundError at runtime.
Fixed by adding build/kotlin-stdlib-2.4.21.jar to d8 input. DEX grew 49KB → 2.3MB.

